# Cron entry to fetch AI news daily and push the collection to GCS.
# Install it with:   crontab -e   (then paste the line below)
# Verify with:       crontab -l
#
# Runs fetch_and_push_news.sh once a day at 07:00 local time.
# It logs to local_uploader/logs/.
#
# minute hour dom month dow  command
0 7 * * * /Users/kamaldhungana/Documents/Coding/pubsub/part1/ingestion/fetch_and_push_news.sh

# --- Older option: sync a local data/ folder instead of fetching news --------
# 0 * * * * /Users/kamaldhungana/Documents/Coding/pubsub/part1/ingestion/push_to_gcs.sh

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# macOS note: cron needs "Full Disk Access" to read/write files in Documents.
#   System Settings -> Privacy & Security -> Full Disk Access -> add /usr/sbin/cron
# Otherwise the script runs but can't see your project folder.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
